  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::AncientTablet
  clueText: "Muhaf\u0131z\u0131n kalbini yumu\u015Fatmay\u0131 ba\u015Farm\u0131\u015Ft\u0131m ama Kutsal Oda'n\u0131n anahtar\u0131 yan\u0131mda olmad\u0131\u011F\u0131 i\xE7in beni i\xE7eri almad\u0131. Do\u011Fudaki dikenli ge\xE7idi a\u015Facak kanatl\u0131 bir dostum olmadan kap\u0131n\u0131n \xF6n\xFCnde bekleyip son nefesimi verdim."
  kitabeSprite: {fileID: 3426236532099899169, guid: 39b9ed74763ab3249abd99cbeb21c0f0, type: 3}
  statueKitabeSprite: {fileID: -3039943098219327909, guid: 26c5f3bc4a7c91547be756a262135014, type: 3}
