  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::AncientTablet
  clueText: "Kan\u0131m zindan ta\u015Flar\u0131na s\u0131zarken ger\xE7e\u011Fi \xE7ok ge\xE7 anl\u0131yorum. Muhaf\u0131z\u0131n kar\u015F\u0131s\u0131nda fani h\u0131rslar\u0131mdan ve ki\u015Fisel \xE7\u0131karlar\u0131mdan bahsetmek \xF6l\xFCm ferman\u0131m oldu. O yaln\u0131zca tap\u0131na\u011F\u0131n kadim miras\u0131na adanm\u0131\u015F bir yemin duymak istemi\u015Fti, benim dilimden ise sadece a\xE7g\xF6zl\xFCl\xFCk d\xF6k\xFCld\xFC."
  kitabeSprite: {fileID: 3426236532099899169, guid: 39b9ed74763ab3249abd99cbeb21c0f0, type: 3}
